    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29715" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δωδεκά̆-θεος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of twelve Gods, cena</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Suet.
				<u>Aug.</u>
				70
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst. - <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεον</span></b> ,
				τό, <i>temple of the twelve Gods,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Inscr.Cos
				43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>medicine compounded of twelve ingredients</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				7.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>primrose, Primula acaulis.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				25.28
			</span></i>.</div>
